]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Kit species, eligibility, focus-or-add, the preview gate, and [bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]scaffolding[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]kit[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]kit: register the notebook and prose species, fix the known kit traps [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](silent created, coordinator kinds, editor focus on a missing loose [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]key), add the exhaustively tested precedence and dual-spelling [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]predicates, add the preview gate that keeps both cards off in the live [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]vault, and pre-create every shared file region the two species phases [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]will fill.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Notebook Card shell with header absorption[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]notebook-card[dim] · [dim][/dim]after kit[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]notebook-card: paint the Notebook Card's identity, title adoption, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]summary or Add-summary ghost, foot, drawer, fold, and editor key from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]local data, and replace the linked notebook header wherever the card [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]mounts.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Prose Card shell, local-first[/bold #D7AFFF]                                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]prose-card[dim] · [dim][/dim]after kit[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]prose-card: paint the quiet title-page Prose Card from local data (folio[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]initial tile, title, dek, crumbs, numbering chip, foot), owning only the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]inline title and coupling its typography to the Bob Prose look.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Notebook Card report-backed readouts[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]notebook-readouts[dim] · [dim][/dim]after notebook-card[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]notebook-readouts: add the note count, newest date, section chips that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]jump to their headings, child notebooks, an error pill, and lint from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the existing shared notebook report, with zero new spawns and no layout [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]shift.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob Prose outline seam and Prose Card measures[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]prose-seam[dim] · [dim][/dim]after prose-card[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]prose-seam: after bob-cli-qj.3 closes, add a read-only versioned [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]api.prose snapshot API to Bob Prose, then paint the card's measure row, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]outline, and findings from it.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Real-Obsidian acceptance and screenshot review for both cards[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]acceptance[dim] · [dim][/dim]after notebook-readouts, prose-seam[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]acceptance: after bob-cli-qi.4 closes, run both cards with the preview [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate on in isolated real Obsidian across the takeover, single-owner, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fail-open, data, focus, and version-skew matrix. Review the screenshot [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]matrix and repair defects until GO.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Switch the cards on, docs, approved memory, and clean deploy[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]go-live[dim] · [dim][/dim]after acceptance[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]go-live: after bob-cli-qi.6 and bob-cli-qj.4 close, delete the preview [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate, extend the passive-rendering proof, finish the docs in both repos,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]apply the accepted memory decisions, and deploy cleanly.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-qm","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-qm.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-00850247d68ebba7fcc2f0bab2f95cd2","started_at":"2026-11-26T17:40:25.620636+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"a47916e50b855c479f799ca924f6c5cc2393cf1798a1a707d84ca29177a83f1c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-qm.6/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"acb7a1e49c5ea909aba144953284858a33365d992deaf1febc4596a43cb70786","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-qm.6/meta.json","size_bytes":718},"prompt":{"digest":"2cb5b7a4c7e0d39d6afc4d27b7b013083bdbb6f11fe2ee5c29a6570c81cc50ad","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-qm.6/prompt.md","size_bytes":211},"state":{"digest":"bb6ffff511c9edde386819973e099bfd13c403d1c2cd0e5bb235f5d974e9a0b0","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-qm.6/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-qm.6","local_name":"bob-cli-qm.6","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-qm","agent_clan_generation":"20261126123940","bead_id":"bob-cli-qm.6","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-qm","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-qm.6","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub","wait_for_beads":["bob-cli-qm.4","bob-cli-qm.5"]},"source_run_id":"run-920e57ee4205f82616e6075bef61b271","started_at":"20261126123945","state":"waiting"},{"ca